// ## 2. Pass-1 — Re-derive zero-trust.oot (5 "20% that matters" claims)

// | # | Claim | On-disk today | Verdict |
// |---|-------|---------------|---------|
// | 1 | One argv contract (rest vs full) and one dispatch table | main.oo:46 slices `rest` from `args[1..]`. Every dispatch (lines 48-66) passes `rest` to handlers. No handler indexes as if args[0] is the subcommand. | PASS — the 2026-09-03 P0 Red 3 prediction is no longer true. |
// | 2 | One compiler locator with one explicit token, no path chain | find_compiler.oo:25 reads OODA_COMPILER first (fail-closed if missing or basename=="ooda"). On miss, falls back to OODA_TOOLCHAIN/bin/oodac (line 39) and HOME/.openooda/bin/oodac (line 45). 3 paths. | PARTIAL — primary is OODA_COMPILER (the audit's "one token" intent), but the chain has 2 fallbacks. The 2026-09-03 audit asked to "kill bin/oodac and ooda/oodac_bin" — those particular paths are killed; OODA_TOOLCHAIN and HOME remain. |
// | 3 | Direct sys_exec of oodac, kill sh -c | host_run.oo:1 says "No shell"; uses sys_exec_wait with direct argv. fix.oo:5 says "No .py and no sh file". install.oo:1 is "Pack-only OODA installer". spawn.oo:18 "Spawn tool subprocess ... Never PATH". The only `sh -c` in repo is in docs/COMMANDS.oot:75 describing the install.sh curl|bash (which lives in install/, not ooda/). | PASS — the 2026-09-03 P0 Red 4 fix is in. |
// | 4 | Real qa probes that fail closed on the bugs | qa/probe_*.oo (7 files) each return Result<Int, String> with explicit Err paths: probe_api_surface.oo (api surface + dead files), probe_argv.oo (rest contract), probe_blackbox_e2e.oo (double-run), probe_fmt.oo (idempotence + traversal), probe_health.oo (health + context), probe_spawn.oo (no PATH), probe_update.oo (hostile flags). | PASS — the 2026-09-03 "vacuous" claim is no longer true. |
// | 5 | Kill dead files | build/args.oo, build/json_check.oo, build/reproducible.oo, fix/patch.oo: all KILLED. scripts/: KILLED (whole directory gone). token/cmd_extra.oo: STILL ON DISK (audit said "superseded by v2; dead twin" — not killed). build/ANCHOR.oo:7 says "8 sub-files"; actual is 12 (drift). | PARTIAL — 4/5 main kill items gone, but token/cmd_extra.oo not killed; the build/ANCHOR.oo sub-file count is stale. |

