// ## 5. Pass-4 — Cross-reference

// (a) main.oo dispatch ↔ docs/COMMANDS.oot
//
// main.oo:48-66 has 21 dispatch entries: bench, build, context,
// digest, fix, fmt, gen, health, init, install, lsp, mcp,
// mcp-merge, opm, run, test, token, update, version, help
// (the last 3 are special). docs/COMMANDS.oot has 17 `###
// ooda <cmd>` headers: bench, build, context, digest, fix,
// fmt, gen, health, init, install, lsp, mcp, opm, run, test,
// token, update.
//
// Drift: docs/COMMANDS.oot is missing `mcp-merge`, `version`,
// and `help` (help is implicitly the no-arg case). MINOR — the
// audit's predicted fix is to add these 3 sections.

// (b) qa/probe_*.oo ↔ zero-trust.oot kill list
//
// The 7 probes each exercise a specific bug. The 2026-09-03
// audit's "vacuous probes" claim is no longer true:
// - probe_api_surface.oo: dead files (4 of the 5 kill items)
// - probe_argv.oo: rest contract (claim 1)
// - probe_blackbox_e2e.oo: build double-run (RULES §1.10)
// - probe_fmt.oo: fmt idempotence + traversal
// - probe_health.oo: health + context contracts
// - probe_spawn.oo: no PATH fallback (claim 3)
// - probe_update.oo: hostile flag parsing
//
// Kill list vs probe coverage:
// | Kill item | Probe? |
// |-----------|--------|
// | build/args.oo | api_surface (file presence) ✓ |
// | build/json_check.oo | api_surface (file presence) ✓ |
// | build/reproducible.oo | api_surface (file presence) ✓ |
// | fix/patch.oo | api_surface (file presence) ✓ |
// | host_run.oo eval/repl | none (functional, not structural) |
// | host_build.oo cli_run_args | none |
// | json_check_version, log_stem, cli_bargs_has_repro | none |
// | token/cmd_extra.oo | none |
// | scripts/{build,test,verify,release}.oo | ci.yml (no scripts/) ✓ |
//
// Most kill items are covered by api_surface; 3 are not.

// (c) build/find_compiler.oo ↔ docs/ENV.oot
//
// find_compiler.oo reads 3 env vars: OODA_COMPILER, OODA_TOOLCHAIN,
// HOME. docs/ENV.oot names 15 env vars: OODA_CACHE, OODA_CHECKOUT,
// OODA_COMPILER, OODA_CONFIG, OODA_CONFIG_FILE, OODA_FS_WRITEDIR,
// OODA_HOME, OODA_INSTALLER, OODA_LOG_LEVEL, OODA_PROFILE,
// OODA_REPO_ROOT, OODA_SRC_ROOT, OODA_STD, OODA_VERSION.
//
// Drift: 12 env vars in docs/ENV.oot are not in find_compiler.oo
// (one-way: docs list more than the code reads). The 3 the code
// reads (OODA_COMPILER, OODA_TOOLCHAIN, HOME) are all in
// docs/ENV.oot (HOME is `OODA_HOME`? No — ENV.oot has OODA_HOME
// but find_compiler.oo uses literal `HOME`. DRIFT in env var
// naming: HOME vs OODA_HOME). MINOR.

// (d) examples ↔ main.oo
//
// examples/build.oot, fix.oot, spawn.oot each match a real
// subcommand. PASS.

