// MINOR (4):
//   m1. token/cmd_extra.oo still on disk. zero-trust.oot:34
//       says "superseded by v2; dead twin" but the file
//       has not been killed. Owner: ooda/ lane.
//   m2. build/ANCHOR.oo:7 says "8 sub-files"; actual is
//       12. ANCHOR.oo count drift. Owner: ooda/ lane.
//   m3. docs/COMMANDS.oot missing `mcp-merge`, `version`,
//       and `help` sections (main.oo has 21 dispatch
//       entries; docs have 17). Owner: ooda/ lane.
//   m4. docs/ENV.oot names 15 env vars; find_compiler.oo
//       reads 3 (OODA_COMPILER, OODA_TOOLCHAIN, HOME).
//       12 doc-only vars (e.g. OODA_CACHE) are unused
//       in this repo. Note: HOME is read as literal
//       `HOME`, not `OODA_HOME` — naming drift.
//       Owner: ooda/ lane.

// NOTE (3):
//   n1. find_compiler.oo is a 3-path chain
//       (OODA_COMPILER, OODA_TOOLCHAIN, HOME). The
//       2026-09-03 audit's "one explicit token, no path
//       chain" was partially addressed. The 3-path
//       chain is more permissive than the audit asked
//       for. NOT a defect; documented for transparency.
//   n2. .github/workflows/ANCHOR.oo is missing
//       (zero-trust.oot:102). The audit said "Either
//       add one or do not treat .github as a product
//       dir." This repo has only ci.yml (no deploy
//       step; this is the source). NOT a finding;
//       documented for transparency.
//   n3. main.oo:36 says "version — print ooda v0.2.16"
//       (hardcoded). Per RULES §1.21 the version
//       should be derived, not declared. The actual
//       current tag is v0.2.27 (per INDEX.oot and
//       the org audit). Hardcoded-version drift.
//       Owner: ooda/ lane.

